# Cluadestrate Environment Variables
# The root scripts do not load this file.
#
# For frontend-specific variables, see: frontend/.env.example
# For backend-specific variables, see: backend/.env.example
#
# Copy the appropriate .env.example files to .env.local (frontend)
# or .env (backend) and fill in the values.

# Quick Start:
# 1. cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env.local
# 2. cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
# 3. Install the root, backend and frontend dependencies as documented in README.md
# 4. npm run dev
